  4. For date comparisons use date() e.g. date("2026-01-01").
  5. For amount_range comparisons, cast to integer: toInteger(t.amount_range) > $amount.
  6. Always alias RETURN fields with AS e.g. RETURN m.full_name AS filer_name, m.bioguide_id AS bioguide_id.
  7. Prefer returning graph entities (nodes, relationships, or paths) so results can render as a graph.
     Good:  MATCH (m:Member)-[r:EXECUTED]->(t:Transaction)-[:INVOLVES]->(a:Asset)
